YourFrame
=========

Third-party material in this app:

Free My TV
  Parts of YourFrame are derived from Free My TV (https://github.com/simbasjungles/free-my-tv):
  build.sh, Adb.java (the client for the TV's own ADB), and the screensaver structure in ArtDream.java and
  ArtView.java (DreamView/Screensaver: slides, worker with a generation counter, crossfade, bitmap release, and the
  decode-at-screen-size approach of Backdrop used in Images.java). Those files say so in a header comment.

